      "description": "Видимые ссылки разделов; активность указана текстом и aria-current.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Разделы\"><a class=\"ds-nav-link\" href=\"#groups\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75M13 7a4 4 0 1 1-8 0 4 4 0 0 1 8 0Z\"/></svg>Группы</a><a class=\"ds-nav-link\" href=\"#materials\">Материалы</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;background:var(--nav-bg,#192738);padding:28px 14px 20px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}.ds-nav-link{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;padding:12px;min-height:44px;border-radius:6px;color:#c8d3e2;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;line-height:1.4}.ds-nav-link svg{width:19px;height:19px;flex-shrink:0}.ds-nav-link:hover{background:#26394f;color:#fff}.ds-nav-link[aria-current=page]{background:var(--nav-active,#30445e);color:#fff;font-weight:600}.ds-nav-link:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #aac3ff;outline-offset:2px}@media(max-width:800px){.ds-nav{flex-direction:row;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:3px;padding:14px 16px 8px}.ds-nav-link{padding:10px;gap:7px}.ds-nav-link svg{width:16px;height:16px}}"
    },
